+						/* fi==3 is the tick (FUN_1048_1acb). At entry (DS=DGROUP),
+						 * walk the live-thread linked list and emit one THREADS line.
+						 * ADSctx far ptr = DS:*(DAT_1068_2608*4 + 0x460e); the third
+						 * loop of the tick fn dereferences its offset near/DS-relative,
+						 * so all node reads are DS-relative. head=ctx+0x10, node fields
